cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "zesty-puzzle: taxi-out time prediction for the PRC Data Challenge 2026"
abstract: >-
  Code of team zesty-puzzle for the EUROCONTROL Performance Review Commission Data Challenge 2026: prediction of the taxi-out time of
  departures at ten European airports from flight-plan and movement data, open adsb.lol ADS-B ground clocks, EUROCONTROL open performance
  data and weather, with stacked gradient-boosting chains, a tabular foundation model used in context and an airport-day set transformer.
authors:
  - family-names: "Melzer"
    given-names: "Luis"
    affiliation: "Team zesty-puzzle"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: "final"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
keywords:
  - taxi-out time
  - air traffic management
  - ADS-B
  - gradient boosting
  - tabular foundation model
  - PRC Data Challenge 2026
